# Cross-origin isolation, so `performance.now()` reports 5 µs granularity
# instead of Chrome's default 100 µs clamp — the runtime panel samples against
# it. Everything the page loads is same-origin, so `require-corp` costs
# nothing. Mirrored in `vite.config.ts` for dev and preview.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
